hello I'm Jason Johansen the homicide  Lieutenant with the Las Vegas  Metropolitan Police Department homicide  section we are asking for the Public's  assistance in solving the tragic murder  of Angel Montano on July 3rd 2022 Angel  attended a social media promoted  birthday party in the backyard of 5100  East Wyoming Avenue which is located  near the area of Wyoming and Nellis  Boulevard  at around 1 30 a.m lvmpd responded to  the residents after receiving multiple  calls stating there were gunshots fired  at the house party upon arrival officers  discovered angel in the backyard  suffering from a gunshot wound Angels  transported to a local hospital where he  was unfortunately pronounced deceased  the suspects are suspects related to  this murder are unknown and are still  outstanding at this time if you attended  this party or had any information  related to this incident contact the  lvnpd homicide section at  702-828-3521 or if you wish to remain  anonymous please contact Crime Stoppers  please help us bring closure to Angel's  family and find the parties responsible  for this tragic murder thank you for  your time
 

